    "Dit ben ik": "This is me",
    "Noem me": "Call me",
    "Wat je moet weten om mij te helpen": "What you need to know to help me",
    "Zo praat je best met mij": "The best way to talk to me",
    "Als ik onrustig ben, helpt dit": "When I’m restless, this helps",
    "Hier raak ik van overstuur": "This upsets me",
    "Waar ik vandaan kom": "Where I come from",
    "Wie bij mij hoort": "The people who belong with me",
